title: "Roxy UI"
abstract: "Web component library for the RoxyAPI catalog. 18 Phase 1 elements covering astrology, Vedic astrology, numerology, tarot, biorhythm, I Ching, crystals, dreams, and angel numbers. Built on Lit. Distributed via npm and jsdelivr. Stateless components driven by typed responses from the OpenAPI spec."
